       "datePublished": "2023-04-09",
       "reviewBody": "Love this salad. Relatively simple but so delicious.  Specially the crunchy salad topping.  It’s going in our regular rotation."
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Fern"
       },
       "datePublished": "2023-04-17",
       "reviewBody": "I have eaten this salad for the past 3 days and I have to say it gets better with time. The kale relaxes and absorbs the luscious dressing. I really like that you can make all the components ahead, makes it so easy to put together! So good!!"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Danni Eldred"
       },
       "datePublished": "2024-11-02",
       "reviewBody": "Great recipe.  The buttermilk dressing is very nice (I used mayo because I didn't want to open a new container of Greek yogurt--glad I did, as it was tasty).  The large amount of dill goes so nicely with the dressing.  Lovely colors and textures.  I will make it again."
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
       "reviewRating": {
        "@type": "Rating",
        "ratingValue": "5"
       },
       "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Herta"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-01-13",
       "reviewBody": "Surprisingly complex and moreish! I mixed the onion with the lemon juice and oil before adding the kale, so no need for the baking soda step. Didn't have fresh dill, so mixed dried with the dressing; flavors melded well. Don't skip the quinoa-nut topper, it's the star!"
      },
      {
       "@type": "Review",
