        "name": "Brianna"
       },
       "datePublished": "2026-02-28",
       "reviewBody": "This is so good. Since I didn’t have buttermilk, I used sour cream, some dill pickle mayo, and almond milk to thin. \r\n\r\nI realize it’s a riff on the recipe based on what I had in my fridge, but the flavors work and this is what’s so fun about cooking!"
      }
